{"book":"1-kings","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T06:32:14.140112609Z","verse":10,"ref":"1-kings 18:10","tier":"bulk","chapter":18,"translation":"As YHWH your Elohim lives, if there ⟨is⟩ a nation and a kingdom which my lord has not sent there to seek you, and they have said, '⟨He is⟩ not there,' and he has caused ⟨את⟩ the kingdom and ⟨את⟩ the nation ⟨to⟩ swear because you have not been found.","tokens":[{"surface":"חי","gloss":"As…lives"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"אלהיך","gloss":"your Elohim"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"if"},{"surface":"יש","gloss":"there ⟨is⟩"},{"surface":"גוי","gloss":"a nation"},{"surface":"וממלכה","gloss":"and a kingdom"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"which"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"שלח","gloss":"has…sent"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"my lord"},{"surface":"שם","gloss":"there"},{"surface":"לבקשך","gloss":"to seek you"},{"surface":"ואמרו","gloss":"and they have said"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"'⟨He is⟩ not'"},{"surface":"והשביע","gloss":"and he has caused…⟨to⟩ swear"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the kingdom"},{"surface":"הממלכה","gloss":"the kingdom"},{"surface":"ואת","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the nation"},{"surface":"הגוי","gloss":"the nation"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"because"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"ימצאכה","gloss":"you have not been found"}]}